---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TourCard from '../components/TourCard.astro';
import HirePlanner from '../components/HirePlanner.astro';
import FleetCards from '../components/FleetCards.astro';
import { getCatalog } from '../lib/catalog';
const tours = await getCatalog();
const pilgrimage = tours.filter(t => t.category_slug === 'dambadiva-pilgrimages');
const island = tours.filter(t => t.category_slug !== 'dambadiva-pilgrimages');
---
<Layout>
  <section class="home-hero"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="sun-mark" aria-hidden="true">✺</span><h1>Your local ride.<br />Your next journey.</h1><p>From a local hire in Pita Kotte to a journey across Sri Lanka. Choose a Nissan Caravan or Mercedes-Benz AMG C-Class, find a guide, or plan your Dambadiva pilgrimage.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href="/local-hires#hire-planner" class="button button-primary">Get a hire quote</a><a href="/fleet" class="text-link">See our fleet</a></div></div><div class="hero-photo"><img src="/images/sigiriya.webp" alt="Sigiriya rock fortress surrounded by Sri Lanka’s green landscape" width="1200" height="900" fetchpriority="high" /><div class="photo-note"><div><strong>An island full of possibilities.</strong><span>Sigiriya, Sri Lanka</span></div><span aria-hidden="true">☀</span></div></div></section>
  <div class="travel-strip"><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s7-6 7-12a7 7 0 10-14 0c0 6 7 12 7 12z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2"/></svg>Local knowledge, thoughtful routes</span><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v12H8l-4 4V5z"/></svg>A real conversation before you travel</span><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-9-5-9-12a5 5 0 019-3 5 5 0 019 3c0 7-9 12-9 12z"/></svg>Journeys shaped around you</span></div>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><HirePlanner /></div></section>
  <section class="section section-soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Meet your next ride.</h2><p>One Nissan Caravan. One Mercedes-Benz AMG C-Class. Local hires, family trips, airport transfers, and special occasions.</p></div><a href="/fleet" class="text-link">Explore our fleet</a></div><FleetCards /></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-intro"><h2>More than getting there.</h2><p>A local team to help with the drive, the route, and the moments along the way.</p></div><div class="values-grid"><div class="value"><h3>A local guide</h3><p>Explore Sri Lanka with arrangements shaped around your interests, language, and pace.</p><a href="/guides" class="text-link">Find guide arrangements</a></div><div class="value"><h3>A sacred journey</h3><p>Explore Dambadiva itineraries and discuss the pilgrimage that suits your family.</p><a href="/dambadiva-tours" class="text-link">Plan a pilgrimage</a></div><div class="value"><h3>A better prepared trip</h3><p>Read practical advice for local hires, vehicle choices, and pilgrimage planning.</p><a href="/news" class="text-link">Read our travel notes</a></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section" id="dambadiva-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>A journey close to the heart.</h2><p>Travel through India and Nepal’s sacred Buddhist sites, with time for worship, reflection, and the moments in between.</p></div><a href="/dambadiva-tours" class="text-link">Discover Dambadiva</a></div><div class="tour-grid">{pilgrimage.map(tour => <TourCard tour={tour} />)}</div>{!pilgrimage.length && <div class="empty-state"><p>Tell us about the pilgrimage you have in mind.</p><button class="button button-primary" data-inquire="Dambadiva pilgrimage">Ask about pilgrimages</button></div>}</div></section>
  <section class="section section-soft" id="sri-lanka-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Our island, at your pace.</h2><p>Ancient cities, misty hill country, wild encounters, and the coast. Find your own way into Sri Lanka.</p></div><a href="/tours?category=sri-lanka-tours" class="text-link">Explore Sri Lanka</a></div><div class="tour-grid">{island.map(tour => <TourCard tour={tour} />)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container story-split"><div class="story-image"><img src="/images/dambadiva.webp" alt="Buddhist temple architecture along the Dambadiva pilgrimage circuit" width="900" height="720" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="story-copy"><h2>Travel is personal.<br />So are we.</h2><p>A pilgrimage with your parents. Your first visit to Sri Lanka. A few days away with the people you love. Every journey starts with a different story.</p><p>We’ll listen to yours, help you choose a route, and talk through the practical details before you decide.</p><a href="/about" class="text-link">The Saumya approach</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section section-soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-intro"><h2>Good to know before you go.</h2><p>A little clarity goes a long way. Our team can help you work through the details.</p></div><div class="values-grid"><div class="value"><h3>Choose your pace</h3><p>Talk through travel distances, walking, rest days, and the places you most want to see.</p></div><div class="value"><h3>Know what’s included</h3><p>Review the itinerary and ask for a written quote covering your dates, accommodation, and transport.</p></div><div class="value"><h3>Plan for your needs</h3><p>Tell us about dietary needs, mobility support, or family arrangements before booking.</p></div></div></div></section>
</Layout>
